  "description": "Subject: Deployment configuration for **my-app.service** (v\u202f1.2.3) \u2013 2023\u201108\u201101  \n\nThe service **my-app.service** will run under the user **appuser** and is defined to launch two instances, each allocated 0.5\u202fCPU units, 256\u202fMiB of memory, and no disk quota. It starts with the command `echo Hello World` and will retry failed launches with a back\u2011off that starts at 10\u202fseconds and grows by a factor of 1.5. The application accepts any resource role (`*`), does not require static ports, and will be reachable on the dynamic ports 8080 and 9090. It depends on the shared library located at `../common-lib`.  \n\nEnvironment variables are set as `ENV_VAR=\"value\"` and `DEBUG=\"false\"`. Labels identify the owning team (`team=devops`) and the application version (`version=1.2.3`). The container is a Docker image `nginx:latest`, pulled on every deployment, running in bridge network mode without privileged access. Port mapping directs container port\u202f80 to a host\u2011assigned port and exposes it as service port\u202f8080 over TCP. A volume mounts `/var/log/nginx` from the host with read\u2011write permission. Health checking is performed over HTTP on path `/health` (port index\u202f0) with a 30\u2011second grace period, 10\u2011second intervals, 5\u2011second timeout, and a maximum of three consecutive failures; HTTP\u202f1xx responses are not ignored.  \n\nThe upgrade strategy allows up to 20\u202f% over\u2011capacity while requiring at least 50\u202f% of instances to be healthy before proceeding. Additional resources are fetched from `http://example.com/resource.tar.gz`, and the application artifact is stored at `http://store.example.com/app`. The configuration was recorded at **2023\u201108\u201101T12:34:56Z**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "id": "my-app.service",
    "cpus": 0.5,
    "mem": 256,
    "disk": 0,
    "instances": 2,
    "cmd": "echo Hello World",
    "user": "appuser",
    "env": {
      "ENV_VAR": "value",
      "DEBUG": "false"
    },
    "labels": {
      "team": "devops",
      "version": "1.2.3"
    },
    "acceptedResourceRoles": [
      "*"
    ],
    "backoffSeconds": 10,
    "backoffFactor": 1.5,
    "requirePorts": false,
    "ports": [
      8080,
      9090
    ],
    "dependencies": [
      "../common-lib"
    ],
    "container": {
      "type": "DOCKER",
      "docker": {
        "image": "nginx:latest",
        "forcePullImage": true,
        "network": "BRIDGE",
        "portMappings": [
          {
            "containerPort": 80,
            "hostPort": 0,
            "servicePort": 8080,
            "protocol": "tcp"
          }
        ],
        "privileged": false
      },
      "volumes": [
        {
          "containerPath": "/var/log/nginx",
          "hostPath": "/var/log/nginx",
          "mode": "RW"
        }
      ]
    },
    "healthChecks": [
      {
        "path": "/health",
        "protocol": "HTTP",
        "gracePeriodSeconds": 30,
        "intervalSeconds": 10,
        "timeoutSeconds": 5,
        "maxConsecutiveFailures": 3,
        "ignoreHttp1xx": false,
        "portIndex": 0
      }
    ],
    "upgradeStrategy": {
      "minimumHealthCapacity": 0.5,
      "maximumOverCapacity": 0.2
    },
    "uris": [
      "http://example.com/resource.tar.gz"
    ],
    "storeUrls": [
      "http://store.example.com/app"
    ],
    "version": "2023-08-01T12:34:56Z"
  }
